  ('fc847f7b-156c-4f00-8786-c3858bccfeb8','The Quiver in Bentonville, Arkansas operates as a USA Archery-affiliated hybrid facility running both a Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) program for younger archers and a separate Adult Archery Program for grown-ups looking for structured instruction. Bentonville has grown fast in recent years alongside the broader Northwest Arkansas region, and a facility offering both youth and adult pathways under one roof suggests it''s built to serve families rather than a single narrow group of shooters. USA Archery affiliation generally means coaching follows the organization''s recognized standards. No lane counts or additional amenities are listed here, so confirming current session times and enrollment for either program is best done directly with The Quiver.'),
