  ('be12ab85-9284-4c4a-aa07-a55b17fd05c7','Top Nock Archery NM in Carlsbad, New Mexico carries an ASA affiliation, tying it into the national 3D archery and bowhunting competition circuit that the Archery Shooters Association organizes. Its ASA status is listed as expired for 2025, so archers hoping to shoot ASA-sanctioned events here should confirm current standing directly with the club before planning around it, since affiliation can lapse and renew. Southeastern New Mexico''s bowhunting community has historically leaned on clubs like this for practice grounds ahead of season, and a direct call is the best way to find out what''s still active on site today.'),
  ('e50c711d-3430-4dfa-86fa-27f2e48e91a2','Townsend Rod & Gun Club in Townsend, Massachusetts holds an ASA affiliation, though its status is listed as expired for 2025, so archers looking to shoot ASA-sanctioned 3D events there should check with the club directly on where things currently stand. Rod and gun clubs across New England often serve multiple shooting disciplines under one roof, with archery sharing space alongside firearms activities, which tends to make them well-established community fixtures even when a single certification lapses. For Massachusetts archers and bowhunters in the area, it remains a name worth a direct inquiry to confirm current archery access, hours, and membership requirements.'),
  ('e2354f8b-95b7-4b8f-9598-782c120a0469','Traditional Archers of Alaska in Wasilla runs a 3D archery course and is listed in the IBO pro shop directory, connecting it to the International Bowhunting Organization''s network of certified 3D shooting locations. That IBO tie suggests the course is built for the kind of foam-animal, unmarked-yardage shooting IBO competitors and bowhunters use to prep for Alaska''s demanding hunting seasons. As a commercial operation, it''s open to shooters without requiring club membership, making it a practical stop for both locals sighting in gear and traveling archers looking for 3D practice in the Mat-Su Valley. Confirm current course details and hours directly before visiting.'),
